+# SmartTube Mobile fork
+
+This fork adds an Android phone build flavor while retaining SmartTube's existing
+service, OAuth, playback, SponsorBlock, settings, and update architecture.
+
+## Build
+
+The initial development APK is built with:
+
+```sh
+./gradlew :smarttubetv:assembleStmobileDebug
+```
+
+The package id is `app.smarttube.mobile`, so it can be installed alongside the
+official SmartTube TV application. The APK output is named using the upstream
+variant naming logic and is written under `smarttubetv/build/outputs/apk/`.
+
+## Current mobile surface
+
+- portrait-first feed with one full-width video card per row
+- two-column feed in landscape
+- horizontally scrollable touch section navigation
+- touch search and account/sign-in buttons
+- tap to play and long-press for the existing video menu
+- existing SmartTube playback, sign-in, and settings activities
+
+The TV build flavors are intentionally unchanged.
